<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-5193] Describe table using full table name in FlinkSQL can not work</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-5193</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If I use describe command in Flink Sql with a full table name like hive.flink.some_table, it will throw a exception;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13018416/13018416_image-2021-01-09-16-18-37-418.png&quot; height=&quot;165&quot; width=&quot;426&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;but if I use &quot;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;use catalog hive;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;use flink;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;describe some_table;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&quot;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;it works;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I check the code,&#160; the &quot;callDescribe&quot; function in &quot;FlinkSqlInterrpeter.java&quot; use &quot;tbenv.scan&quot; to get table schema;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;the scan function need a string array when use a full table, but 0.9.0 version call it with a string.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13018415/13018415_image-2021-01-09-16-19-58-087.png&quot; height=&quot;163&quot; width=&quot;724&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
